One's Complement :

Obtained by flipping all the bits.
ex]
0000 1101 (binary of 13)
1111 0010 (one's complement of 13)


Two's Complement :

Obtained by taking the one's complement of a number and then adding 1.
ex] 
Find the one's complement:

  0000 1101 (binary of 13)
  1111 0010 (one's complement of 13)

Add 1 to the one's complement:

1111 0010
+       1
__________
1111 0011

so, Two's Complement -> 1111 0011
